      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.53,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "-: Well, that was a lot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 6.66,
          "en": "But I wanna mention two more things or show two more things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.66,
          "end": 11.13,
          "en": "One is, a more detailed control over the individual steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.13,
          "end": 14.22,
          "en": "during the animation process here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "We already saw that we can define multiple phases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "but each phase gets the same importance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 22.98,
          "en": "It would be nice if you could define some keyframes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.98,
          "end": 27.57,
          "en": "to specifically say, \"Okay, you animate over one second.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.57,
          "end": 30.21,
          "en": "After 200 seconds you should have this state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.21,
          "end": 34.38,
          "en": "after 500 seconds you should have this state and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.38,
          "end": 36.21,
          "en": "Well, we can do this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.21,
          "end": 39.18,
          "en": "I'm copying my trigger here a final time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.18,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "And here, I want to set up list two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "which in my template I bind to my second list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "which uses the same data of a source.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 52.38,
          "en": "So here, @list2 sets up the trigger to bind it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.38,
          "end": 54.93,
          "en": "and then we can set up the animations here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.93,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "Well, I'll leave the In state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 61.32,
          "en": "but for the transition, when coming in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.32,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "I wanna change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 66.6,
          "en": "Here, I don't want to specify a normal array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.6,
          "end": 69.36,
          "en": "as I did before to have these different,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.36,
          "end": 71.55,
          "en": "equally weighted phases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 76.11,
          "en": "Instead, I'll pass an argument, which is still an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.11,
          "end": 80.55,
          "en": "but there in the animated function, let's say one second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.55,
          "end": 84.12,
          "en": "I use the keyframes method as the second argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "This needs to be imported from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 91.47,
          "en": "Now the keyframes method here in the animate function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.47,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "allows me to be more precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 96.69,
          "en": "Which part of multiple styles I can now set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.69,
          "end": 98.97,
          "en": "should occur at which timing?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.97,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "The overall animation will take one second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 105.24000000000001,
          "en": "but I can now control, which state inside of that animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "should take how long?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 110.03999999999999,
          "en": "So here, keyframes, therefore is always an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.03999999999999,
          "end": 112.2,
          "en": "with now the individual phases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.2,
          "end": 115.08,
          "en": "And there, I simply apply a couple of styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.08,
          "end": 117,
          "en": "with the style method again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "So let's say when we let it enter, it should transform.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "And at the beginning we have it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 127.92,
          "en": "on the left as before, minus 100 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.92,
          "end": 131.913,
          "en": "We also set up the opacity as before to zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.9,
          "end": 136.11,
          "en": "Now let's say, we want to have another style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.11,
          "end": 138.3,
          "en": "during that fly in animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.3,
          "end": 141.66,
          "en": "Here we want to have transform,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.66,
          "end": 144.213,
          "en": "set this to translateX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.65,
          "end": 146.793,
          "en": "50 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.9,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "minus 50 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 150.84,
          "en": "So halfway there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.84,
          "end": 152.73,
          "en": "cause we want to end at zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.73,
          "end": 154.35,
          "en": "translateX zero at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.35,
          "end": 156.39,
          "en": "that is our final state up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.39,
          "end": 157.223,
          "en": "that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.49,
          "end": 163.16,
          "en": "We wanna animate the opacity to already be at 0.5.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.48,
          "end": 168.3,
          "en": "And then we have yet another style, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 170.43,
          "en": "where we wanna say, okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.43,
          "end": 174.69,
          "en": "the transform function is now almost there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 179.073,
          "en": "So translateX is now minus 20 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.48,
          "end": 184.26,
          "en": "But importantly, opacity is one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.26,
          "end": 186.72,
          "en": "So we're done when it comes to opacity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.72,
          "end": 190.083,
          "en": "but we're not completely at the position we wanna be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 192.33,
          "en": "This will work like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.33,
          "end": 197.28,
          "en": "I can now save this, and if we let this reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.28,
          "end": 199.05,
          "en": "you should watch the bottom list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.05,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "You already saw it upon the initial fly in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 202.28300000000002,
          "en": "and you should see it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.28300000000002,
          "end": 204.423,
          "en": "if you watch the comparison to the top list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.53,
          "end": 208.47,
          "en": "If I add a new item, this is much slower",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.47,
          "end": 210.752,
          "en": "and it starts fast, and then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.752,
          "end": 211.585,
          "en": "(moans fast)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 211.585,
          "end": 213.72,
          "en": "takes very long for the last bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.72,
          "end": 217.14,
          "en": "The reason for this is, that by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.14,
          "end": 219.39,
          "en": "all these steps here take equally long.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.39,
          "end": 222.21,
          "en": "I have three elements here in my keyframes array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.21,
          "end": 226.47,
          "en": "and then, every style is triggered after a third,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.47,
          "end": 228.45,
          "en": "the third of a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 228.45,
          "end": 229.8,
          "en": "I can override this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 229.8,
          "end": 233.767,
          "en": "By passing the offset property, I can say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.767,
          "end": 237.93,
          "en": "\"At which timing of these, 1000 milliseconds in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.93,
          "end": 239.64,
          "en": "should you be at this state?\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.64,
          "end": 243.33,
          "en": "So the first state is at the beginning offset zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.33,
          "end": 245.34,
          "en": "Then here, let's say, we want to be at this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.34,
          "end": 248.07,
          "en": "not after half of the time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.07,
          "end": 249.45,
          "en": "which it would make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.45,
          "end": 253.38,
          "en": "because we are halfway in and halfway the opacity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.38,
          "end": 255.28,
          "en": "But we wanna be at this point after",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 257.288,
          "end": 260.46,
          "en": "0.3 of our animation time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.46,
          "end": 262.32,
          "en": "So 30% of our animation time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.32,
          "end": 264.78,
          "en": "so 300 milliseconds in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 264.78,
          "end": 268.08,
          "en": "And we wanna be almost done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 268.08,
          "end": 269.407,
          "en": "after, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 271.927,
          "end": 272.76,
          "en": "0.8.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 273.65999999999997,
          "end": 276.52,
          "en": "And then I will add a final style here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.15,
          "end": 283.53,
          "en": "with an offset of one, where I'm done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 283.53,
          "end": 284.90999999999997,
          "en": "This is my final keyframe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.90999999999997,
          "end": 287.88,
          "en": "so that it doesn't snap at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.88,
          "end": 290.67,
          "en": "Well, with this, if I let it reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 290.67,
          "end": 292.89,
          "en": "we saw it here upon the initial loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 292.89,
          "end": 294.12,
          "en": "And if I add a new item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 294.12,
          "end": 296.283,
          "en": "it starts fast,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 298.89,
          "end": 300.12,
          "en": "but then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 300.12,
          "end": 302.43,
          "en": "smoothly finishes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 302.43,
          "end": 306.39,
          "en": "This is how we use keyframes to control precisely,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.39,
          "end": 308.82,
          "en": "which stage we want to have at which time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.82,
          "end": 310.23,
          "en": "during the transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 310.23,
          "end": 311.07,
          "en": "That's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 314.25,
          "en": "Keyframes are for the time during the transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 314.25,
          "end": 317.1,
          "en": "So over the time of such animated function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 317.1,
          "end": 318.27,
          "en": "and of course you could still have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 318.27,
          "end": 320.73,
          "en": "multiple animate functions as we had before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 320.73,
          "end": 323.16,
          "en": "in that array, you pass to the transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 323.16,
          "end": 325.02,
          "en": "it could have multiple animate functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 325.02,
          "end": 327.33,
          "en": "and each animate functions could have multiple keyframes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 327.33,
          "end": 329.853,
          "en": "So, unlimited possibilities here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
